flowchart TB
    subgraph TOP["Quality-on-top"]
        A1[ETL job] -->|writes to| B1[(main table)]
        B1 -->|visible to| C1[Dashboards]
        B1 -->|checked by| D1["dbt / Monte Carlo"]
        D1 -->|alert| E1[Slack alert]
        E1 -.->|too late| C1
    end
    subgraph WAP["WAP Pattern"]
        A2[ETL job] -->|writes to| B2[(branch)]
        B2 -->|audited by| D2{"Audit pass?"}
        D2 -->|Yes| F2[(main table)]
        D2 -->|No| G2[Quarantined]
        F2 -->|visible to| C2[Dashboards]
    end
